  "description": "WebForms Core is a command-driven, server-oriented web technology that brings the desktop programming experience to web UI development. It enables direct and deterministic control of the HTML DOM without page reloads or modern front-end frameworks. Built on a Commander–Executor architecture, the server issues explicit UI commands while the client acts as a pure executor. WebForms Core is stateless on the server, framework-agnostic on the backend, HTML-native, and capable of operating online, offline, or without a server. It supports event-driven HTML, real DOM manipulation without a Virtual DOM, and multiple communication models including HTTP, AJAX, SSE, and WebSockets.",
